      "name": "REQ_026",
      "label": "\n\t\t\t\t<B>Requirement</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<B>Views as Projections</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<BR/>\n\t\t\t\tViews SHALL be treated as projections of a single underlying model graph by sele<BR/>cting a set of card types (and optional subtypes) and rendering only those cards<BR/> and the links between them; views SHALL NOT change the underlying model.<BR/>\n\t\t\t",
