      "_gvid": 1,
      "name": "REQ_025",
      "label": "\n\t\t\t\t<B>Requirement</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<B>Model Integrity Validation</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<BR/>\n\t\t\t\tAurora models SHALL be machine-validatable for integrity: every non-Mission, non<BR/>-Note card SHALL have at least one incoming link; every card SHALL be reachable <BR/>from the Mission; and all links[].target values SHALL reference an existing card<BR/> id.<BR/>\n\t\t\t",
