      "label": "\n\t\t\t\t<B>Requirement</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<B>Identifiers, Filenames, and Model Layout</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<BR/>\n\t\t\t\tAurora cards SHALL use stable identifiers (e.g., MIS-001) that MUST NOT change o<BR/>nce issued. Card files SHALL be named &lt;id&gt;-&lt;Sanitized_Name&gt;.json, where specia<BR/>l characters are stripped and spaces are replaced with underscores. Models SHALL<BR/> follow the Model Home and Mission folder layout conventions so tools can discov<BR/>er, validate, and render deterministically.<BR/>\n\t\t\t",
